 413               /      ROUTINE TO WRITE A BLOCK OF TAPE.
 414               
 415               /       CALLING SEQUENCE:
 416               
 417               /       TAD     (FORWARD BLOCK) /AC CONTAINS FORWARD BLOCK NUMBER
 418               /       JMS I   (BLOCK)         /CALL BLOCK WRITE ROUTINE
 419               /       DATA WORD COUNT         /COUNT OF DATA WORDS IN BLOCK
 420               /       REVERSE BLOCK           /REVERSE BLOCK NUMBER
 421               
 422               /       THIS ROUTINE WILL WRITE:
 423               
